<title>CHINA: China says 35 killed, 35 injured in plane crash.</title>
<headline>China says 35 killed, 35 injured in plane crash.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The death toll from the crash of a China Southern Airlines Boeing 737 in the southern city of Shenzhen has risen to 35, a city government official said on Friday.</p>
<p>It was unclear if any of the 33 passengers killed in the crash on Thursday evening were foreigners, the official said by telephone. The two others killed were crew members.</p>
